<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Radico Khaitan Limited v. Glare Glass Traders &amp; Ors., ARB.P. 1011/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Om Prakash Shukla J</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>5 November 2026</td></tr>
